stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unhydrated
    Unhydrated --> Deferred: 身份尚未对齐
    Unhydrated --> Reading: 可读且所有者明确
    Deferred --> Reading: 身份条件解决后重读
    Deferred --> Abandoned: 所有者变更或验证失败
    Reading --> Restored: 无更新的输入冲突
    Reading --> PreserveNewEdit: 已有较新的编辑
    Reading --> Abandoned: 世代或所有者已变化
    Restored --> Writable: 非临时且通过写入条件
    PreserveNewEdit --> Writable: 恢复阶段已安全完成
